><span begin="00:37.902" end="00:38.118">when </span><span begin="00:38.118" end="00:38.671">you </span><span begin="00:38.845" end="00:39.198">look </span><span begin="00:39.405" end="00:39.637">at </span><span begin="00:39.637" end="00:40.350">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.030" end="00:45.846"><span begin="00:42.030" end="00:42.277">Or </span><span begin="00:42.277" end="00:42.741">am </span><span begin="00:42.741" end="00:43.311">I </span><span begin="00:43.311" end="00:44.733">somebody </span><span begin="00:44.733" end="00:45.846">else</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.949" end="00:51.510"><span begin="00:47.949" end="00:48.256">Hm-</span><span begin="00:48.256" end="00:48.550">mm-</span><span begin="00:48.550" end="00:48.999">mm </span><span begin="00:48.999" end="00:49.422">hm-</span><span begin="00:49.422" end="00:49.719">mm-</span><span begin="00:49.719" end="00:50.463">mm </span><span begin="00:50.463" end="00:51.510">mm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.974" end="00:58.321"><span begin="00:53.974" end="00:54.230">I </span><span begin="00:54.230" end="00:54.727">watch </span><span begin="00:54.727" end="00:55.015">the </span><span begin="00:55.015" end="00:55.967">movie </span><span begin="00:56.199" end="00:56.462">you </span><span begin="00:56.614" end="00:57.063">play </span><span begin="00:57.294" end="00:57.551">for </span><span begin="00:57.551" end="00:58.321">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.809" end="01:03.684"><span begin="00:59.809" end="01:00.058">I </span><span begin="01:00.058" end="01:00.659">am </span><span begin="01:00.659" end="01:00.929">the </span><span begin="01:00.929" end="01:01.490">face </span><span begin="01:01.699" end="01:02.245">on </span><span begin="01:02.517" end="01:02.692">the </span><span begin="01:02.692" end="01:03.684">screen</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.645" end="01:09.957"><span begin="01:05.645" end="01:05.942">I </span><span begin="01:05.942" end="01:06.324">put </